text: You are attempting to apply <rule name>, which has the form\n<indent 5><rule form>\nto the line<rfp s>\n<indent 5><rule form premises>\nand perhaps to the conclusion\n<indent 5><wff>\nHowever, on the basis of the scheme of substitution you have supplied, the expression "<pattern>" in the statement of the rule does not map to the line you have cited.
