id: DerNot021
text: An occurrence of the instantial term "<inst term>" \nwill be captured by a quantifier in the original \nformula.\n\nIf we replace all free occurrences of "<gen var>" in\n<indent 5><gen wff>\nwith the instantial term "<inst term>", we obtain\n<indent 5><inst wff>,\nin which a *new* occurrences of "<inst term>" in \n<indent 5><op wfe>\nhas been captured by the quantifier phrase "<op phrase>".\n\nIn answer to the request to specify an instantial \nterm to replace "<gen var>", you must specify a term that \nwill not be captured by a quantifier that already \nexists in \n<indent 5><gen wff>\n
